{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqpbskhu2qn","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"Tested status does not release blocking dependencies","summary":"In this workspace, worker completion commonly reports implementation tasks as tested, and require_review allows a later promotion from tested to done. Blocking dependency readiness still checks effective(dep)==done, so judge tasks blocked by implementation tasks remain not_ready until the implementation is explicitly promoted to done. Dispatchers should promote verified tested tasks to done with the workspace pinned when the intent is to release judge/follow-up tasks; otherwise full-auto can appear stuck with completed work parked at tested.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-22T14:43:33.954Z","vec":null,"vecs":null,"vecMeta":{"provider":"minilm","model":"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2","dimensions":384,"identity":"minilm:Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2:384"},"vecsMeta":null,"actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-22T14:43:33.980Z"}
